    {
      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "Ivanti Neurons agents connect endpoints to the platform for management. You can deploy them three ways: automated policy assignment, manual installation, or Neurons push installation. Automated policy assignment uses rules to choose policies; manual install uses a selected policy and enrollment key; push install deploys remotely to chosen devices using a deployment-capable agent and OS credentials. For example, a rule can assign laptop devices one policy automatically. Key terms: agent — endpoint software; policy — agent settings; enrollment key — registration key; credentials — elevated-access login.",
      "id": "1948b71b-e689-442c-8c1d-e59a4837a942",
